<%# The note itself reaches every viewer -- including its author -- through the
    model's append broadcast, so nothing is appended here; that is what stops the
    author seeing it twice.

    The composer is data-turbo-permanent (it must survive refresh morphs), which
    means Turbo will not replace it from a stream either. It clears itself in the
    note_composer Stimulus controller instead. %>
<%= turbo_stream.update "notes_count", @registration_request.reload.notes_count %>
